## How the skill relates to the specification folder

The specification folder `{{spec_dir}}/` is canonical. It holds the conventions, the schedule, the index and one file per work item. The skill carries the conventions and points at those files. It does not replace them.

- The conventions and definition of done in `SKILL.md` are copied from `{{spec_dir}}/README.md` and `plan.yaml`. A pull request that changes them there updates `SKILL.md` in the same pull request.
- The contracts reference lists headings. The owning work item file holds the contract.
- The map of approved source sections is generated from the bundles. When a release adds or removes a section, the plan owner refreshes the map.
- Owners, status and dates of record live in the GitHub issues.
